\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 A single dose of the Pfizer/BioNTech Covid jab in people who have never had Covid generates an immune response similar to that seen in those who previously had Covid but have not yet been vaccinated, researchers have revealed.}
